FilesReverse
------------

A Small utility and replacement for the internal "N"ewfiles door.

Filelistings will be listed in reverse order, and user can flag files
to download while listing directory.


INSTALL:

Copy the directory "LBBS_Tools" and its contents, into your DOORS
 directory.


Create a setupfile in {BBSMAINPATH}COMMANDS/BBSCMD called 'FR'


Cut out below lines and insert into the FR file.
>-----------------------------------------------
NAME		FilesReverse
ACCESSLEVEL	5
LOCATION	DOORS:LBBS_Tools/FilesReverse
 PASSWORD
 RETURNSTATUS
PRIORITY	1
STACK		4096
 RETURNOUTPUT
 QUICKMODE
TYPE		XIM
------------------------------------------------<


From the menu prompt users can type FR, and upload directory will be
listed in reverse order.

